              "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/0803.4121",
              "locator": "Section 2.1-2.2: local relations (2.3)-(2.8) and the grading (2.12) (deg dot = 2, deg crossing = -i.j); Section 2.3 polynomial representation and Theorem 2.5."
            },
